left='''<section class="first-result"><h3>First test passed.</h3><p>Cleaned one pane in 24 seconds.<br>6 m/s wind / Minimum suction 39 kPa</p></section><p class="speaker">Scenario agent / Suggested coverage</p><p class="assistant-text">Wind and dust need more cases: they interact at the seal.</p><section class="proposal"><h2>Test this on 40 worlds</h2><p>8 dust, 8 wind; 6 each for moisture, friction, edges and heat. I kept cases that stress a different mechanism.</p><div class="proposal-actions"><a class="button primary" href="app-3.html">Run all 40 worlds</a><a class="text-link" href="#scenario-grid">See the 40 worlds</a></div></section><section class="not-tested"><h3>Not tested <span class="small muted" style="float:right;padding-top:6px">No pass claimed</span></h3><ul><li>Seal wear over months</li><li>Water entering the electronics</li><li>Tether and anchor fatigue</li></ul><button class="button" type="button">Send to a bounty</button></section>'''
